    "BookTrace does not require a BookTrace account and does not include advertising or analytics SDKs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BookTrace does not require a BookTrace account and does not include advertising or analytics SDKs."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BookTrace, BookTrace hesabı gerektirmez; reklam veya analiz SDK'ları içermez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BookTrace erfordert kein BookTrace-Konto und enthält keine Werbe- oder Analyse-SDKs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your library, reading sessions, goals, notes and quotes are stored on your device. When iCloud is available, this data syncs through your private iCloud database using your Apple Account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your library, reading sessions, goals, notes and quotes are stored on your device. When iCloud is available, this data syncs through your private iCloud database using your Apple Account."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kütüphanen, okuma oturumların, hedeflerin, notların ve alıntıların cihazında saklanır. iCloud kullanılabiliyorsa bu veriler Apple Hesabın üzerinden özel iCloud veritabanında eşitlenir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Bibliothek, Lesesitzungen, Ziele, Notizen und Zitate werden auf deinem Gerät gespeichert. Wenn iCloud verfügbar ist, werden diese Daten über deine private iCloud-Datenbank mit deinem Apple Account synchronisiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search terms and ISBNs are sent to Open Library and, when needed, Google Books. Those services receive network information such as your IP address. Book covers are downloaded from their image services.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Search terms and ISBNs are sent to Open Library and, when needed, Google Books. Those services receive network information such as your IP address. Book covers are downloaded from their image services."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arama terimleri ve ISBN'ler Open Library'ye ve gerektiğinde Google Books'a gönderilir. Bu hizmetler IP adresin gibi ağ bilgilerini alır. Kitap kapakları bu hizmetlerin görsel sunucularından indirilir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suchbegriffe und ISBNs werden an Open Library und bei Bedarf an Google Books gesendet. Diese Dienste erhalten Netzwerkinformationen wie deine IP-Adresse. Buchcover werden von ihren Bilddiensten heruntergeladen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Camera access is used only when you scan a barcode or a page. Text recognition runs on your device; BookTrace does not upload page photos.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera access is used only when you scan a barcode or a page. Text recognition runs on your device; BookTrace does not upload page photos."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kamera erişimi yalnızca barkod veya sayfa tararken kullanılır. Metin tanıma cihazında çalışır; BookTrace sayfa fotoğraflarını yüklemez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Kamera wird nur zum Scannen eines Barcodes oder einer Seite verwendet. Die Texterkennung erfolgt auf deinem Gerät; BookTrace lädt keine Seitenfotos hoch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple processes purchases. BookTrace reads verified purchase status to unlock Pro; it does not receive your payment card details.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple processes purchases. BookTrace reads verified purchase status to unlock Pro; it does not receive your payment card details."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Satın alımları Apple işler. BookTrace, Pro'yu açmak için doğrulanmış satın alma durumunu okur; ödeme kartı bilgilerini almaz."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple verarbeitet Käufe. BookTrace liest den verifizierten Kaufstatus, um Pro freizuschalten, und erhält keine Zahlungskartendaten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You choose when to export or share your reading data. Erasing the library removes its books, sessions, notes, quotes and goals; with iCloud enabled, deletions can sync to your other devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You choose when to export or share your reading data. Erasing the library removes its books, sessions, notes, quotes and goals; with iCloud enabled, deletions can sync to your other devices."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Okuma verilerini ne zaman dışa aktaracağını veya paylaşacağını sen seçersin. Kütüphaneyi silmek kitapları, oturumları, notları, alıntıları ve hedefleri kaldırır; iCloud açıksa silme işlemleri diğer cihazlarına eşitlenebilir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du entscheidest, wann du deine Lesedaten exportierst oder teilst. Das Löschen der Bibliothek entfernt Bücher, Sitzungen, Notizen, Zitate und Ziele; bei aktiviertem iCloud können Löschungen mit deinen anderen Geräten synchronisiert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
